                "text": "If you do remove +1/+1 counters, you must remove all of them. You can't fine-tune the carnage by only removing some of them."
            },
            {
                "date": "2021-02-05",
                "text": "You may choose to remove Sarulf's +1/+1 counters even if that would cause lethal damage to be marked on Sarulf. If you do this, Sarulf will die after its last ability is finished resolving."
