            {
                "date": "2021-02-05",
                "text": "The card you exile with the boast ability is exiled face up."
            },
            {
                "date": "2021-02-05",
                "text": "Playing a card this way follows the normal rules for playing the card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all applicable timing rules. For example, if the card is a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."
            },
            {
                "date": "2021-02-05",
                "text": "Under normal circumstances, you can play a land this way only if you haven't played a land yet that turn."
            },
